Career Evidence Graph is an independent project.

Its information architecture is inspired by the public interaction patterns of
Semantica (https://github.com/semantica-agi/semantica), which is not affiliated
with CASCO or this project. No Semantica source code is included here.

Public demo data is anonymized and illustrative. It is not an official CASCO
product, hiring assessment, or statement of CASCO's internal systems.
